  <!-- EN: Fireball Launcher -->
  <Gun_FireballGrenadeLauncher.label>火球发射器</Gun_FireballGrenadeLauncher.label>
  <!-- EN: A wide-barreled multi launcher. The shells create heavy incendiary explosions on impact. The quickshot mechanism can burst out up to 5 grenades at once. A technical marvel and real beauty for any heavy gunner.\n\nLost Forsaken Tech. -->
  <Gun_FireballGrenadeLauncher.description>一款宽管多管发射器。弹药在击中目标时会引发剧烈的燃烧爆炸。其快速射击机制可一次性连发多达5枚手榴弹。对于任何重火力射手而言，这既是一项技术奇迹，也是一件真正的瑰宝。

失落的被遗弃者科技。</Gun_FireballGrenadeLauncher.description>
