  <!-- EN: Army grenade -->
  <Weapon_GrenadeArmy.label>军用手榴弹</Weapon_GrenadeArmy.label>
  <!-- EN: Adopted standard army design fragmentation grenade. It packs a special explosive device in a round housing for a vast detonation. Wide spreaded, pretty oldschool and easy to craft.\n\nThe belt is loaded with these basies. -->
  <Weapon_GrenadeArmy.description>采用标准军用设计的破片手榴弹。它在圆形弹体中装有特殊爆炸装置，可引发大规模爆炸。爆炸范围广，颇具复古风格，且易于制作。

弹带中装填的正是这些基础手榴弹。</Weapon_GrenadeArmy.description>
  <Weapon_GrenadeArmy.verbs.Verb_LaunchProjectile.label>军用手榴弹</Weapon_GrenadeArmy.verbs.Verb_LaunchProjectile.label>
  <!-- EN: Death container -->
  <Weapon_GrenadeDeath.label>死亡容器</Weapon_GrenadeDeath.label>
  <!-- EN: Grenade with a death cloud blasting composition. Space Marines call this 'Pandoras Box' in fear of its horrifying effect. In times before adoptive medical emergency modules (A3Ms) were integrated as military standard, this planetary havoc came above many humanoid as xenomorphic beings. Something is written in small letters underneath...\n\nCaution: Open at your own risk. Virus will outbreak of containment. -->
  <Weapon_GrenadeDeath.description>一种带有致命烟云爆炸效果的手榴弹。太空陆战队因其骇人的破坏力而将其称为“潘多拉之盒”。在适应性医疗应急模块（A3M）尚未成为军事标准之前，这种足以摧毁行星的灾难曾降临在许多类人及异形生物身上。下方用小字写着……

警告：开启需自担风险。病毒将突破封锁爆发。</Weapon_GrenadeDeath.description>
  <Weapon_GrenadeDeath.verbs.Verb_LaunchProjectile.label>死亡容器</Weapon_GrenadeDeath.verbs.Verb_LaunchProjectile.label>
  <!-- EN: Disintegrator -->
  <Weapon_GrenadeDisintegrator.label>解体器</Weapon_GrenadeDisintegrator.label>
  <!-- EN: Grenade with a disintegration blasting composition. Its blueprint underlies an ultratech assembling. Creates a small wave of pure destruction, while beeing liftable without additional servomotors for the grenadier.\n\nThe belt is loaded with these babies. -->
  <Weapon_GrenadeDisintegrator.description>一种采用解体型爆破配方的手榴弹。其蓝图基于超科技组装工艺。能引发一小波纯粹的破坏，且手榴弹手无需额外伺服电机即可投掷。

弹带中装满了这些小家伙。</Weapon_GrenadeDisintegrator.description>
  <Weapon_GrenadeDisintegrator.verbs.Verb_LaunchProjectile.label>解体器</Weapon_GrenadeDisintegrator.verbs.Verb_LaunchProjectile.label>
  <!-- EN: Napalm bomb -->
  <Weapon_GrenadeNapalm.label>凝固汽油弹</Weapon_GrenadeNapalm.label>
  <!-- EN: Special grenade with a napalm blasting composition. A real firestarter due to is hydrophobic characteristics. Detonates in a huge wave of flames.\n\nAlias: The Rainmaker. -->
  <Weapon_GrenadeNapalm.description>一种装有凝固汽油弹爆炸物的特殊手榴弹。由于其疏水特性，堪称真正的“点火专家”。引爆时会引发巨大的火焰浪潮。

别名：雨神。</Weapon_GrenadeNapalm.description>
  <Weapon_GrenadeNapalm.verbs.Verb_LaunchProjectile.label>凝固汽油弹</Weapon_GrenadeNapalm.verbs.Verb_LaunchProjectile.label>
  <!-- EN: Plasma grenade -->
  <Weapon_GrenadePlasma.label>等离子手榴弹</Weapon_GrenadePlasma.label>
  <!-- EN: Grenade with a smolder blasting composition. Its ultratech blueprint originates from the nebula wars, when two whole universes fought each other. The detained plasma melts through any kind of armor, especially through such, which is sensible to high temperature fluctuations by particle mixtures on atomic-molecular level. Requires rare materials.\n\nThe belt is loaded with these babies. -->
  <Weapon_GrenadePlasma.description>一种采用阴燃爆破配方的手榴弹。其超科技蓝图源自星云战争时期——那时两个完整的宇宙曾相互征战。其中封存的等离子体能熔穿任何类型的装甲，尤其对那些在原子-分子层面因粒子混合而对高温波动敏感的装甲效果显著。制作需使用稀有材料。

弹匣里装满了这些小玩意儿。</Weapon_GrenadePlasma.description>
  <Weapon_GrenadePlasma.verbs.Verb_LaunchProjectile.label>等离子手榴弹</Weapon_GrenadePlasma.verbs.Verb_LaunchProjectile.label>
  <!-- EN: Atomic Bomb -->
  <Weapon_GrenadeWarhead.label>原子弹</Weapon_GrenadeWarhead.label>
  <!-- EN: Grenade with an ultra-tech warhead powered by a grain of evaine antimatter. Usually used by forsaken grenadiers and war machines, it creates a huge explosion and starts fires around the detonation point.\n\nFragile and dangerous. Handle with care. -->
  <Weapon_GrenadeWarhead.description>这种手榴弹装有由一粒埃瓦因反物质驱动的超科技弹头。通常由“被遗弃者”的榴弹兵和战争机器使用，它会引发巨大爆炸，并在爆炸点周围引发大火。

易碎且危险。请小心处理。</Weapon_GrenadeWarhead.description>
  <Weapon_GrenadeWarhead.verbs.Verb_LaunchProjectile.label>原子弹</Weapon_GrenadeWarhead.verbs.Verb_LaunchProjectile.label>
</LanguageData>